  "changes": [
    "Validate static and actually declared dynamic two-axis ports against catalogue source constructors; reject undeclared template-shaped ports.",
    "Retain active and inactive two-axis state through native documents, source archives and builtin-random captures beyond the five Polar Mirror properties.",
    "Sample unlinked axes before PCX expressions; preserve linked producers and original animator ownership; skip dormant combined drivers.",
    "Preserve Group empty Range and Vec2 constructor reload behavior.",
    "Verify Solid output dimensions and PCX scalar projection, integer Matrix Get coordinates, linked priority, inactive drivers and six dynamic axis inputs.",
    "Verify source archive projection/reopen for all four admitted constructor kinds, retaining dormant tuples and opaque extra axes."
  ],
  "repaired_batch_issues": [
    "Initial new test compile errors repaired together: missing projection header and Catch INFO expression grouping.",
    "First joined run found two Group empty-control import regressions. Excluded Group controls from ordinary empty-constructor shortcut.",
    "First joined run found unsupported Matrix PCX array processing in the proposed changed-result fixture. Used the existing Solid Dimension scalar getter to verify expression ordering without widening PCX execution."
  ],
